{
  "biological_interpretation": "SLC7A6OS loss exposes a recurrent RNA-processing/Pol-II stress state rather than a cell-type-private response; the pattern is plausible as a target-engagement panel but not a direct measurement of the annotated protein\u2019s transport or nuclear biology.",
  "caveats": [
    "SLC7A6OS protein loss, nuclear import, and Pol-II function were not directly measured.",
